<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Distillers raises yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Distillers raises yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30 1996.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     93.5	  vs    69.8</p>
<p>Div (cts)</p>
<p>    - interim		 17.0	  vs    14.0</p>
<p>    - final		   42.0	  vs    35.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	  130.95	 vs    97.71</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  226.61	 vs   182.99</p>
<p>    Tax			 86.39	 vs    74.80</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,532.58	 vs 1,247.87</p>
<p>    Full name:   Distillers Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>Div payable October 18</p>
<p>on register September 20.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
